          "symbol": null
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "chunk-6e26ee889962cededda5b592fdb65c8638e92974b684d337218eebe3bd42d952",
          "quote": "适用于单主机单指标 gauge/rate，依赖 metrics-py312-stdlib/1，不需要历史基线。\nupper 分数为 x-T，lower 分数为 T-x。严格 score>0 才是异常候选；等号不触发。\n业务阈值必须来自用户明确值或有引用的业务材料；假设阈值要标为 candidate_assumption。\n本材料没有给定任何指标的业务阈值；禁止虚构业务达标保证。\ncalibration 不改变固定阈值 T；共享可信告警器处理连续点数和事件合并。",
          "symbol": null
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "chunk-4cde96ee5d5f4c785edb11ca42de730e583dec8ac36327aa9388973ab7666a09",
          "quote": "    def fit(self, train_points):\n        if not any(point[\"value\"] is not None for point in train_points):\n            raise ValueError(\"no valid training observations\")\n        self.reset()\n\n    def reset(self):\n        pass",
          "symbol": null
        }
      ],
